NOTICE / ATTRIBUTION

This package is a derivative work. Its model code (src/palfit/_model.py) is a
Python port of the adult model in the R package INSP-RH/bw
(https://github.com/INSP-RH/bw), file src/adult_weight.cpp. Equations, constants,
and the order of operations are transcribed from that file; they were not re-derived.

